BT 1 0 0 1 12 41 Tm -8 0 Td 12.6 TL /F1 9.4 Tf 0 0 0 rg (\177 ) Tj /F2 9.4 Tf (Why a structured sequence?) Tj /F1 9.4 Tf ( Each stage assumes the guarantees of the previous one: import checks structure,) Tj T* 8 0 Td (validation checks scope and ranges, cleaning standardises names \(so duplicates become visible\), reshaping gives) Tj T* -0.065726 Tw (the shape that joins need, merging needs unique keys, and export needs final, verified data. Changing the order \(for) Tj T* 0 Tw (example deduplicating before standardising\) produces wrong results, as the www/http example shows.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 51.35433 430.0701 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 12 41 Tm -8 0 Td 12.6 TL /F1 9.4 Tf 0 0 0 rg (\177 ) Tj /F2 9.4 Tf (How modular functions and systematic transformations help:) Tj /F1 9.4 Tf ( correctness \(each function is testable with) Tj T* 8 0 Td (boundary cases and return codes\), maintainability \(the UDP change touched the key and validator only\), efficiency) Tj T* (\(the awk single-pass refinement was swapped in without changing callers\) and reuse \(the same functions) Tj T* (processed 192.168.57.0/24\).) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 51.35433 390.2701 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 12 28.4 Tm -8 0 Td 12.6 TL /F1 9.4 Tf 0 0 0 rg (\177 ) Tj /F2 9.4 Tf (Additional costs:) Tj /F1 9.4 Tf ( validation and rejected files add code and storage; error handling and review queues need) Tj T* 8 0 Td (analyst time \(10 of 81 rows needed attention\); repeated scanning adds network load and time; integrating sources) Tj T* (needs agreed keys and aggregation rules \(otherwise row multiplication\).) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
