1 0 0 1 51.35433 337.8701 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 12 41 Tm -8 0 Td 12.6 TL /F1 9.4 Tf 0 0 0 rg (\177 ) Tj /F2 9.4 Tf (When the pipeline becomes inefficient, unreliable or unsuitable:) Tj /F1 9.4 Tf ( millions of rows where Bash/awk become) Tj T* 8 0 Td (memory- and speed-limited \(a database or Python/Pandas would be better\); sources with changing formats; many) Tj T* (conflicting duplicates \(review becomes the bottleneck\); requirements that need relationships beyond one-to-many) Tj T* (keys; or live networks where state changes between scans so stored data is stale.) Tj T* ET
Q
