1 0 0 1 51.35433 272.8701 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 53.6 Tm 12.6 TL /F2 9.4 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Conclusion - characteristics of a reliable, efficient, maintainable scan-data pipeline for evolving networks:) Tj /F1 9.4 Tf  T* (authorization and scope enforcement first; explicit schema and stable keys that can evolve \(ip, port, proto\); fail-fast) Tj T* (validation with a visible reject/review trail so nothing is silently dropped; reproducibility \(versioned, checksummed,) Tj T* (deterministic output\); modular, parameterised functions with clear return codes; performance measured rather than) Tj T* (assumed; human review where data is ambiguous; and history across sessions to see change, not just a snapshot.) Tj T* ET
Q
